--- parse -- generic, tree-shakeable parsing framework.
---
--- This is a trait-abstraction library: the Parser and DynParser traits
--- live in Rust (plugin-lib-parse) and are implemented by concrete parser
--- crates (url-rfc, url-whatwg). There are no callable handl ops here;
--- the .hnl file exists to declare the library's capability surface for
--- the plugin system.
